{"a":[10,10],"h":"<p>10.<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"116\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 116.1 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 16.6 27.8 34.6 48.8 66.8 66.8 77.3 77.3 84.8 91.6\" y=\"25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"16.6 34.6 48.8 84.8 91.6 99.8\" y=\"25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> Hem Asanı bırak - ya'ni bu makamda bulunan başka bir şey'e dayanmamalıdır. <svg class=\"ea\" width=\"227\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 227.0 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 16.6 16.6 27.0 27.0 33.7 54.7 61.6 69.7 69.7 76.6 83.3 103.6 103.6 103.6 111.0 117.7 117.7 126.0 141.7 148.6 157.6 157.6 164.3 181.6 188.3 188.3 197.3 204.0\" y=\"26.3 26.3 26.3 21.0 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 21.0 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"33.7 61.6 69.7 76.6 83.3 111.0 126.0 148.6 164.3 188.3 197.3 204.0 210.7\" y=\"26.3 26.3 21.0 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 21.0 26.3 26.3 26.3\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> - «Nun» un şeddesile cann, hafif ve seri' yılan, ya'ni bırakınca o Asayı sanki çevik bir yılanmış gibi çalkanıyor gördü, görünce<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"106\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 105.6 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.4 23.3 23.3 30.7 30.7 37.4 37.4 46.4 46.4 62.3 73.4 73.4 73.4 81.0\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"81.0 89.3\" y=\"25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> arkasını dönerek kaçtı<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"103\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 103.3 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.4 16.4 16.4 33.0 33.0 33.0 39.7 46.4 46.4 62.3 62.3 71.3 78.7\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"39.7 71.3 78.7 87.0\" y=\"25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> ve geri bakmadı - korktu<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"151\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 151.3 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 16.6 34.6 47.3 54.0 75.0 86.3 97.6 105.8 105.8 121.6 128.3\" y=\"26.3\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"34.6 47.3 58.6 86.3 128.3 135.0\" y=\"26.3\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> korkma ya Musâ!<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"238\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 238.3 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 16.6 27.0 35.3 35.3 53.3 53.3 60.8 60.8 69.8 69.8 77.3 93.0 93.0 106.6 115.6 132.0 132.0 150.0 156.8 169.6 176.3 197.3 208.6 208.6 208.6 215.3 215.3\" y=\"25.4 25.4 20.3 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 26.3 25.4 26.3\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"16.6 42.0 42.0 93.0 106.6 115.6 156.8 169.6 180.8 222.0\" y=\"25.4 25.4 25.4 20.3 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> zira benim korkmaz huzurı ızzetimde Resul olanlar - ya'ni ben şimdi sana risalet veriyorum, Peygamber gönderilmek üzere vahy-ü ta'limat alıyorsun, Peygamberlere böyle vahy olundukları sırada korkmak yaraşmaz, ruhları temamen melekûte müncezib ve huzurı ızzette evâmir telâkkısine müstagrak olurlar da ondan korku hatırlarına bile gelmez. Gerçi «<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"257\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 256.8 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 9.7 9.7 9.7 9.7 9.7 18.0 18.0 18.0 27.0 33.7 33.7 40.4 40.4 48.0 63.7 63.7 70.4 70.4 78.0 84.7 91.4 91.4 109.4 109.4 120.0 120.0 135.7 142.4 142.4 142.4 149.2 156.7 172.4 183.7 195.7 195.7 208.4 224.2 231.0 240.0 240.0 246.7 246.7\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 20.3 15.0 25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"27.0 84.7 135.7 183.7 208.4 231.0 240.0\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 20.3\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> » buyurulduğu ve Peygamberler ise ulemanın a'lemi bulundukları cihetle onlarda Allah korkusu herkesten ziyadedir. </p>"}